SUMMARY:dUMBASS bALD 11 mile on AT CARDIO hike
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\nThis is primarily a fitness orient
 ed event. While we try to stay together as a group\, we will not wait for 
 extended periods at intersections. If you haven't hiked with this fitness 
 group before and are unsure of your abilities\, be prepared and know your 
 way back to your car. If carpooling is involved please do so appropriately
 \, or drive yourself to the trailhead.\n\nDetails\n5.5 miles SOUTH (OPPOSI
 TE DIRECTION FROM BIG BALD) on the AT from sams gap to the clearing which 
 has some views\, stop for Osa to have a snack (or 2 or 3) and return. brin
 g food and water. off leash unruly dogs are welcome. it's around 2\,700 el
 evation gain.
