SUMMARY:Rescheluded: 4 Waterfalls
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\nReservations open at **8:00 P.M**.
  on Friday.\n\nWaterfalls include Graveyard Fields Upper Falls\, Lower Fal
 ls\, Yellowstone Falls\, Skinny Dip Falls.\n\n8 miles\, 1\,200+ feet of el
 evation\, darn tough trails\, pace approx. 2 mph. Must have the strength\,
  stamina\, and stability to complete safely the hike. Hiking poles\, hikin
 g boots/shoes\, long pants recommended. This is not a dog friendly hike.\n
 \nStart at Looking Glass Overlook and take social trails (unmarked\, unmap
 ped trails) up to and along Pisgah Ridge. Then take a social trail down to
  Graveyard Fields parking lot. Graveyard Fields Trails takes us up to Uppe
 r Falls\, then back down to Lower Falls. After that\, it's MST to the top 
 of Yellow Stone Falls\, and MST takes us down to Skinny Dip Falls and back
  to our cars.\n\nWe'll **carpool** from the French Broad River Overlook. *
 *Leave at 8:30 A.M.**\n\n**Release of Liability:**\nThe organizer of this 
 trip is a volunteer and not a professional guide. The function of the orga
 nizer is only to organize this trip. If you sign up or participate in this
  event you acknowledge that you freely and voluntarily agree to assume all
  risks of injuries\, illnesses\, and damages arising from\, as a result of
 \, and associated with this event. In addition\, you acknowledge that you 
 agree to the Meetup Terms of Service: https://help.meetup.com/hc/en-us/art
 icles/360027447252-Terms-of-Service#h_9e385395-a405-4361-8afc-854a4f586c82
 .
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevillehikinggroup/events/314938439
 /
